## . [go] Go tools=go
build                    Build          inferred high   safe        .          go build ./... :: Build Go packages
test                     Testing        inferred high   safe        .          go test ./... :: Run Go tests
vet                      Quality        inferred high   safe        .          go vet ./... :: Check Go source with go vet
fmt                      Quality        inferred high   safe        .          go fmt ./... :: Format Go source
lint                     Quality        inferred high   safe        .          golangci-lint run :: Lint Go source with golangci-lint
tidy                     Other          inferred low    safe        .          go mod tidy :: Tidy Go module dependencies
run:migrate              Development    inferred high   safe        .          go run ./cmd/migrate :: Run the migrate command
run:worker               Development    inferred high   safe        .          go run ./cmd/worker :: Run the worker command
generate                 Build          inferred high   safe        .          go generate ./... :: Run go:generate directives
